{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"Wolfcraft CMS Website","created_at":"2025-01-14T08:20:18.531Z","published_at":"2025-12-08T13:11:09.200Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:11:09.220Z","id":608528270,"uuid":"f3e7f76c-731b-403d-a2e6-bd8c080504a9","content":{"_uid":"0a50eb47-353c-43a7-93b9-c65698e87178","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"3f8384e6-fc83-4ef2-b034-480168480b93","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"c7a241aa-3cdc-4b54-ad8c-ba568a0e2694","text":"Die Wolfcraft GmbH ist ein mittelständisches Familienunternehmen mit über 700 Mitarbeitern in 50 Ländern. Seit 70 Jahren entwickelt Wolfcraft intelligente Produkte im Bereich Werkzeug und Elektrowerkzeug. Mit über 3000 Artikeln sowie 550 Patenten sind sie Mitgründer und Impulsgeber für die DIY-Branche.\n\n---\n","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"small","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"Intuitives CMS für den innovativen Werkzeughersteller","content_align":"center","content_width":"narrow","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Wolfcraft","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"accent","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"2200d8d2-0860-45f2-9c33-58cf20cc3662","type":"section","style":"accentTransition","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"b0bc5608-da41-43c4-99d5-dde0a5ccae3b","stat":[{"_uid":"74bfef2c-76cb-4ccb-b504-95b0bb4293a8","type":"stat","title":"Corporate Website","number":"1","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"c0a780fa-1b3b-43c8-ba49-54c8633e87d8","type":"stat","title":"Produkt & Projektdatenbanken","number":"2","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"fde5cbcc-72e5-4587-9e9e-40229d57972d","type":"stat","title":"Länderwebseiten","number":"20","component":"stat","description":""}],"type":"stats","component":"stats"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"accent","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"21bbd375-adee-429f-843b-7b47fa855e4b","type":"section","style":"","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"6cd9a90c-d8b3-43cc-b327-2d9a74c4d005","text":"","type":"hero","height":"fullImage","buttons":[],"overlay":false,"textbox":false,"headline":"","component":"hero","image_alt":"","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"","textPosition":"","highlightText":true,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/3840x1914/72f00f8c2d/wolfcraft_visual_01.png","image_srcTablet":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/3840x1914/72f00f8c2d/wolfcraft_visual_01.png","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/3840x1914/72f00f8c2d/wolfcraft_visual_01.png"}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"accent","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"29814330-127c-4d51-99d6-668eacb86d9f","type":"section","style":"","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":true,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Effiziente Integration und Präsentation von Content und Produktdaten","_uid":"bd0e55be-d457-4d1c-82cc-e8d0190c2188","text":"Die Wolfcraft musste ihren umfangreichen Content und das breite Produktportfolio ansprechend und pflegeleicht auf ihrer Website präsentieren. Mit über 3000 Artikeln war es entscheidend, den bestehenden Content erlebnisreich darzustellen und die SAP-basierte Produktpalette effizient in das CMS zu integrieren.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Die Herausforderung","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"","textAlign":"center","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"#494948","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"sub":"","_uid":"54bb8233-2952-4202-9fc9-f57944c491df","text":"Content Marketing ist ein wichtiger Baustein für die Online-Marketing-Strategie von Wolfcraft. Notwendige Bedingung für den Erfolg von Content Marketing sind hochwertige Inhalte (Content) und deren Präsentation.\n\n \n\nUm den Content von Wolfcraft optimal in Szene zu setzen, wurde ein TYPO3 speziell an die Bedürfnissedes Unternehmens angepasst um mit dem Content Management System ein besonders hohes Maß an gestalterischer Freiheit zu erreichen. Die Bandbreite verschiedener Inhaltselementen, sind Online-Redakteure in der Lage informative und benutzerfreundliche Inhaltsseiten zu erstellen, die von Suchmaschinen optimal indexiert werden.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Lösung und Vorgehen","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Screenshots der Wolfcraft Webseite","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1501x1949/1e462f209e/wolfcraft_sprachen_01.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":false,"backgroundColor":"#666666","backgroundImage":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x1000/84f4252f4b/wolfcraft_hintergrund_02.svg","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"sub":"","_uid":"70f76243-c814-43a0-b082-953652ce1e2c","text":"Um auch das breite Produktportfolio der 20-sprachigen Website möglichst aktuell und ansprechend darzustellen, bietet die von ruhmesmeile entwickelte Produkt-Extension, eine Vielzahl an Darstellungsmöglichkeiten. \n\nDie Produktdaten werden hierbei durch eine SAP-Datenbank gespeist. Die hierfür nötige Schnittstelle hat ruhmesmeile entwickelt.  Durch die flexiblen Anbindungsmöglichkeiten, kann das System in Zukunft um E-Commerce-Funktionen erweitert werden.  \n\n","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Screenshots der Wolfcraft Webseite","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2004x2857/9028e17fb5/wolfcraft_holz_bearbeiten_01.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":false,"backgroundColor":"#333333","backgroundImage":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x1000/9b9d76aac8/wolfcraft_hintergrund_04.svg","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":false}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"none","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52add920-07c4-47fa-bff0-6bbc3fd82b7f","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"0476414f-5a89-4d92-8c83-79fe2be94d75","text":"**Industrie & Branche**\n\n- Maschinenbau\n- Metallverarbeitung\n- Global\n\n--- ","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"6bda06ca-221d-412d-89c8-294349ad4049","text":"**Design System Services**\n\n- Technische Konzeption \n- Frontend-Entwicklung  \n- Custom SAP-Anbindung\n\n---","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"1f5aff21-1426-4a85-9ba3-300fdf6aed90","text":"**Technologien**\n\n- HTML & CSS, BEM\n- Typo3\n- Patternlab\n\n---","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default"},{"_uid":"52b4584f-97f1-4604-b795-abfaf72ec91a","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"4d94e53e-6014-49ab-9690-e4ea4af3958f","text":"Die maßgeschneiderte TYPO3-Lösung ermöglichte Wolfcraft eine deutlich verbesserte Online-Präsenz. Der Content wurde erlebnisreich und benutzerfreundlich präsentiert, was die Nutzererfahrung erheblich steigerte. Die effiziente Integration der SAP-basierten Produktdaten in das CMS sorgte für stets aktuelle Produktinformationen und vereinfachte die Pflegeprozesse erheblich. Insgesamt führte dies zu einer stärkeren Markenpräsenz und trug zur Festigung von Wolfcrafts Position als führender Innovator in der DIY-Branche bei.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Impact","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/3000x1436/f96144cf86/wolfcraft_evolution_3.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_ui